  "metadata": null,
  "notes": [
    "mysql.wsrep_cluster_members reports port 0 for galera-1, galera-2, galera-3, so only the host is shown: with wsrep_node_incoming_address AUTO the node takes the port mysqld had when wsrep started. Set wsrep_node_incoming_address to host:port to report the client port.",
    "Failures tolerated assumes equal pc.weight on every node (the default): a Primary component needs more than half of the total weight.",
    "wsrep_flow_control_paused and the queue averages cover the time since the provider's statistics were last reset (FLUSH GLOBAL STATUS) or since start.",
    "Galera exposes only this node's own state: the other nodes are listed as members of the component without a verdict. Connect to a node to inspect it."
  ],
